<div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">KITCHEN TOOLS</p><h1>Cooking calculators</h1><p class="muted">Quick conversions without flour on your phone.</p></div></div>
<div class="calculator-grid">
<section class="panel calculator" data-converter="volume"><h2>Volume</h2><div class="converter-row"><input type="number" step="any" value="1" aria-label="Volume amount"><select aria-label="From volume unit"><option value="4.92892159375">teaspoons</option><option value="14.78676478125">tablespoons</option><option value="236.5882365" selected>cups</option><option value="29.5735295625">fluid ounces</option><option value="1">milliliters</option><option value="1000">liters</option></select><span>to</span><select aria-label="To volume unit"><option value="4.92892159375">teaspoons</option><option value="14.78676478125">tablespoons</option><option value="236.5882365">cups</option><option value="29.5735295625">fluid ounces</option><option value="1" selected>milliliters</option><option value="1000">liters</option></select></div><output></output><small>US customary volume. Cup-to-weight conversions depend on the ingredient.</small></section>
<section class="panel calculator" data-converter="weight"><h2>Weight</h2><div class="converter-row"><input type="number" step="any" value="100" aria-label="Weight amount"><select aria-label="From weight unit"><option value="1" selected>grams</option><option value="1000">kilograms</option><option value="28.349523125">ounces</option><option value="453.59237">pounds</option></select><span>to</span><select aria-label="To weight unit"><option value="1">grams</option><option value="1000">kilograms</option><option value="28.349523125" selected>ounces</option><option value="453.59237">pounds</option></select></div><output></output></section>
<section class="panel calculator" data-converter="temperature"><h2>Oven temperature</h2><div class="converter-row"><input type="number" step="any" value="350" aria-label="Temperature"><select aria-label="From temperature unit"><option value="f" selected>°F</option><option value="c">°C</option></select><span>to</span><select aria-label="To temperature unit"><option value="f">°F</option><option value="c" selected>°C</option></select></div><output></output></section>
<section class="panel calculator" data-converter="scale"><h2>Scale a recipe</h2><div class="scale-row"><label>Original servings<input type="number" min="0.01" step="any" value="4"></label><label>Desired servings<input type="number" min="0.01" step="any" value="6"></label></div><output></output><small>Multiply every ingredient quantity by this factor.</small></section>
</div>
